# Memnarch, the Warden: "When Memnarch enters, create two 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature tokens" and "Whenever
# Memnarch attacks, draw a card for each artifact you control." Memnarch comes out on turn 5 off three Islands, Black Lotus
# and four Moxen (ten mana) and makes both Myr at once, colorless. On turn 7 it attacks: Bot1 controls seven artifacts of its
# own (Memnarch, four Moxen, two Myr) and draws seven, and Bot2's Sol Ring, which it does not control, is not one of them.

